        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l001",
        "reading": "„По двою дн҃ью, реч[е], азъ взыдох и Іюда съ ѡц҃емъ моимъ",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l002",
        "reading": "къ праѡц҃ю нш҃ему Исаку, и бл҃сви мя ѡц҃ь ѡц҃а моего по всемъ",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l003",
        "reading": "словесемъ видѣнія моего, еже видех, и не въсхоте ити с нами",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l004",
        "reading": "в Вифел. и егда приидохом в Вифель, виде ѡц҃ь мой Іаковъ в ви-",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l005",
        "reading": "дѣніи ѡ мнѣ, ꙗко буду имъ въ жречество къ Боу҃. и въставъ",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l006",
        "reading": "заутра ѡдесятори вся мною Гви҃. и приидохом в Хевронь селом,²⁷)",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l007",
        "reading": "и ту Исакъ призываше мя часто въспоминат[и] законъ Гс҃нь,",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l008",
        "reading": "ꙗкоже научи мя анг҃лъ Гнь҃. и учаше мя закону чтителства,",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l009",
        "reading": "жертвамъ, всесъжженіемъ, начаткомъ, воламъ, сп҃сеніемъ,",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l010",
        "reading": "како жрети ми чстотою ума Боу҃ Вышнему. и бяше по вся дн҃и",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l011",
        "reading": "вразумляа мя и ѡ мнѣ упражнялся²⁸) пред Бг҃омъ. тѣмъ ж[е]",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l012",
        "reading": "и в разуменіи гл҃а ми: „внемлеши ѡ дсѣ блуднем, то бо частитъ",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l013",
        "reading": "и хощет ѡскверневлевати племенемъ твоимъ ст҃ая. поймеши убо",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l014",
        "reading": "жену еще юнъ си, не имеюще²⁹) зазора ни ѡсквернену, ни ѿ пле-",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l015",
        "reading": "мени иностраных ни ѿ языкъ. и преж[е] вшествія [в] ст҃ая",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l016",
        "reading": "мый ся; и егда хотя жрети, оумывай ся. ві҃-ть же древъ выну",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l017",
        "reading": "имеющих листвіе приноси Гви҃, ꙗко и мене Авраамъ научи. и вся-",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
      {
        "line_id": "isaac-instructions-l018",
        "reading": "ког[о] живот[а] чст҃аго и птицъ чст҃ыхъ приноси Гви҃ жертвы,",
        "reason": "Historical type: exact titla, accents, superscripts and restorations provisional."
      },
